    "audio/rws-e3-en/tts-1.input.ssml": {
      "content": "<speak><amazon:effect name=\"drc\"><prosody rate=\"95%\"><p><s>Immigration sharply declined.</s></p><p><s>By this time, anti-immigration sentiments in the U.S. became so strong that a growing number of people demanded laws to make it harder for foreigners to become U.S. citizens.</s></p><p><s>In 1882, Congress also passed the Chinese Exclusion Act.</s></p><p><s>From about 1820 to 1870, millions of people made the voyage to the United States, mostly from northern and western Europe.</s></p></prosody></amazon:effect></speak>",
      "contentType": "application/ssml+xml",
      "encoding": null
    },
